					],
					"speakerTitle": "悦子"
				},
				{
					"id": 721560102,
					"content": "それじゃあ、さっそく残りの「鎮め石」の場所に行こう。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721560103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大祐"
				},
				{
					"id": 721560103,
					"content": "「鎮め石」をすべて封印できれば、雷も鎮まるはずだ。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721560104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大祐"
				},
				{
					"id": 721560104,
					"content": "行こう。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721560105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721560105,
					"content": "あの「寝子」の言ったこと、本当だといいんだけど…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721560106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大祐"
				},
				{
					"id": 721560106,
					"content": "まあ、これが雷に関する唯一の手がかりだから…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721560107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "悦子"
				},
				{
					"id": 721560107,
					"content": "何はともあれ、残り2つの「鎮め石」のところに行きましょう。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721560108,
						721560109
